[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3997417309","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116961#issuecomment-3997417309","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116961","id":3997417309,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uQ79d","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-04T13:02:42Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T13:06:28Z","body":"This appears to be a shader error.\n\nThe mistake is in this line:\n\n```glsl\nfloat copied = texture(texture_in, vec2(coord + 0.5) / size, 0).r;\n```\n\nYou probably meant to use `textureLod` instead. The shader also fails SPIR-V validation on Vulkan:\n\n> error: SPIRV-Tools Validation Errors\nerror: Image Operand Bias can only be used with ImplicitLod opcodes\n  %67 = OpImageSampleExplicitLod %v4float %56 %64 Bias|Lod %float_0 %float_0\n\nThis is likely because there are no derivatives in a compute shader, so you cannot really sampl